This repository is an independent analysis of a defect in Dify. Its own prose, reproduction
scripts and captured evidence are released under the MIT licence, below.

It also quotes source from langgenius/dify and ships a patch against it. Those excerpts remain
under Dify's own licence — a modified Apache License 2.0 with additional conditions — reproduced
in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md alongside the list of what is quoted and from which revision. Apache
License 2.0 section 4(a) is why that copy is here.

